title: "Sentinel Git-OPS: A DevSecOps Tactical CLI for Standardized and Secure Git Workflows"
type: software
version: 2.3.1
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22904347"
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Chavatte"
    given-names: "João Carlos"
abstract: "Sentinel Git-OPS is an interactive DevSecOps CLI for standardized Git workflows. It provides branch lifecycle operations, remote management and multi-push, authentication helpers, status and audit utilities, recovery actions, localization, and an optional pre-commit scan for common secret patterns. The project ships separate Bash and PowerShell implementations for Unix-like and Windows environments."
keywords:
  - DevSecOps
  - Git
  - Git workflow
  - cybersecurity
  - secure software development
  - command line interface
  - secret scanning
  - PowerShell
  - Bash
repository-code: "https://github.com/chavatte/sentinel-git-ops"
url: "https://github.com/chavatte/sentinel-git-ops"
